  "term": "Tegretol",
  "definition": "Tegretol is carbamazepine, a tricyclic chemical related to tricyclic antidepressants. It has anticonvulsant and pain-relieving properties and works as an anticonvulsant by reducing polysynaptic responses and blocking post-tetanic potentiation.",
